# Ignore everything
*

# Allow the .gitignore itself
!.gitignore

# Whitelist project folders
!2026년 뉴로골프 챔피언십/
!Maze Crawler/
!NVIDIA Nemotron Model Reasoning Challenge)/
!obit game/
!ai라이브/
!connect-ai-music/
!연구자동화 에이전트/
!Documents/
!.gemini/

# Allow everything inside these folders
!2026년 뉴로골프 챔피언십/**
!Maze Crawler/**
!NVIDIA Nemotron Model Reasoning Challenge)/**
!obit game/**
!ai라이브/**
!connect-ai-music/**
!연구자동화 에이전트/**
!Documents/**
!.gemini/antigravity/scratch/**

# Explicitly ignore huge/unwanted folders
.gemini/antigravity-browser-profile/
.gemini/antigravity/brain/
.gemini/antigravity/logs/
**/outputs/
**/checkpoints/
**/offload/
**/unsloth_compiled_cache/
**/*.pth
**/*.h5
**/*.onnx
**/*.safetensors
**/*.gguf
**/*.zip
**/*.mp4
**/*.exe
**/__pycache__/
**/*.pyc
**/node_modules/
**/.git/
